        "message": "feat(P0-002): generate the Session Result from metrics (D146)\n\nThe declared stub exits 1 by design. It is now a real generator: SHORT and FULL\n§20 output read entirely from docs/state/metrics/<session>.json, with a structured\nresult block in that file for the fields that were not numeric sources. No value\nis composed from memory. Required fields go through text/array/numeric guards;\na missing one exits 1 with its path, and NOT COMPUTABLE is emitted only for an\nexplicit null in a measured source.\n\nTwo runs are byte-identical. Removing result.status from a metrics copy exits 1;\nan invalid --format exits 1. The stale note saying the result was hand-composed\nis replaced by a D146 note. pnpm verify remains 17/17; the stub banner is gone\nfrom the deferred list.\n\nAgent: orchestrator\nTask: P0-002",
